stremio (4.4.181-orp3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Start from the released ORP2 baseline only.
  * Keep the same pinned RK3588 FFmpeg/libmpv/libplacebo revisions.
  * Keep direct V4L2-request hardware decoding as the preferred hwdec path.
  * Disable libavcodec direct rendering (`vd-lavc-dr=no`) inside the libmpv
    render-API client to test whether DR-backed allocation causes the failing
    HEVC Main10 NV15 pitch observed on the 1920x804 board sample.
  * Do not carry forward any code from the historical ORP3+ experiments.

 -- stremio-Opi5-Armbian maintainers <noreply@github.com>  Tue, 01 Sep 2026 16:45:00 +0100

stremio (4.4.181-orp2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Bundle a private pinned FFmpeg/libmpv stack under /opt/stremio/rk3588.
  * Enable the RK3588 V4L2-request hardware-decoding userspace path.
  * Keep private multimedia libraries isolated from system package libraries.
  * Validate private libmpv/libavcodec linkage in native ARM64 CI.

 -- stremio-Opi5-Armbian maintainers <noreply@github.com>  Sun, 30 Aug 2026 16:30:00 +0100

stremio (4.4.181-orp1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Build the official Stremio 4.4.181 shell natively for Ubuntu 26.04 ARM64.
  * Use Ubuntu's system libmpv and generated shared-library dependencies.
  * Remove the obsolete explicit librubberband2 package dependency.

 -- stremio-Opi5-Armbian maintainers <noreply@github.com>  Sat, 29 Aug 2026 17:00:00 +0100
